{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"christopher-fairbank","name":"Christopher Fairbank","birthDate":"1953-10-04","birthPlace":"Hertfordshire, England, UK","bio":"Christopher E. Fairbank (born 4 October 1953) is an English actor. He is best known in the UK for playing Moxey in the comedy-drama series Auf Wiedersehen, Pet. Fairbank has appeared in Coronation Street, Batman, Doctor Who, and Shakespeare & Hathaway: Private Investigators. He has a recurring role in the Guardians of the Galaxy films as The Broker, and in two guest stints in 2024 and 2026, portrayed Eddie Knight in EastEnders.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Christopher Fairbank, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:38:34+00:00","tmdbId":8399,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/8399","credits":[{"id":"guardians-1","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy","character":"The Broker","characterFa":"کارگزار"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/christopher-fairbank.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Ebenezer","year":2026,"character":"Old Joe","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6H2N59jJW1hZEzn2ZdrMvJw5vNI.jpg"},{"name":"Pierre","year":2026,"character":"Sean Lambert","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lj7oMz6fvrGPRuJ2pv5S4Io60kZ.jpg"},{"name":"100 Nights of Hero","year":2025,"character":"Beaked Brother Charles","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u2lCBD7ZjcBsCLnDgWVDP9TsghG.jpg"},{"name":"Scoop","year":2024,"character":"Elderly Man","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ib3H2ZSeVRTAmd7EtGWV31LswaZ.jpg"},{"name":"Constellation","year":2024,"character":"Yura","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/21ICs3fxlxGslbzS4moCHk9HNo6.jpg"},{"name":"Truelove","year":2024,"character":"Trevor","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xwuYkLlW6ZYQHrZfHmjf9TvZ1iZ.jpg"},{"name":"Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3","yea